  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: add MEAI guide template to autosdk init scaffolding 2026-03-29\n- feat: support dotted schema namespaces (#198) 2026-03-28\n- feat: add TreatWarningsAsErrors to SDK project template 2026-03-27\n- feat: Inline array support and deepObject serialization for object query params 2026-03-22\n- feat: Extract inline object schemas from bindings and skip object-type query params 2026-03-21\n- feat: Extract inline enum schemas from bindings.ws.query to components 2026-03-21\n- feat: Support inline schemas in bindings.ws.query + snapshot test 2026-03-21\n- feat: Generate typed ConnectAsync with query params from AsyncAPI channel bindings 2026-03-21\n- feat: Native upstream AsyncAPI spec support — inline payloads, per-channel servers, operationTraits 2026-03-21\n- feat: Add const discriminator support for AsyncAPI specs 2026-03-21\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: refresh snapshots and generation outputs 2026-04-01\n- fix: avoid flattening composite request wrappers 2026-03-29\n- fix: include wrapped required request properties 2026-03-29\n- fix: pin pygments<2.20 in autosdk init template 2026-03-29\n- fix: prefer composite converters for inline enum unions 2026-03-29\n- fix: pin pygments<2.20 to fix MkDocs build 2026-03-29\n- fix: guard required typeless query parameter serialization 2026-03-29\n- fix: honor x-enum-varnames in newtonsoft params 2026-03-29\n- fix: defer tag collision resolution until after reassignment 2026-03-29\n- fix: deduplicate top-level authorizations 2026-03-29",
